      "description": "Time to get a response FROM the backend, not what the browser saw: TLS, the SSO redirect dance and Envoy's own work are outside it. Buckets jump 0.5, 1, 5, 10, 25 ms and later 30s, 1m, so a quantile landing inside a wide bucket is interpolated, not measured."
